  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Social Media Engagement'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1200' minheight='900' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='10000' id='2' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <formatted-text><run bold='true' fontsize='20'>How post format and timing relate to engagement</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>500 posts from one cosmetics brand's Facebook page, 2014. Engagement rate = (likes + comments + shares) / reach. All values are medians. Orange = photo posts, blue = non-photo posts (status, link, video).</run></formatted-text>
            <zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='42000' id='3' name='Engagement by Format' w='50000' x='0' y='10000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style></zone>
          <zone h='42000' id='4' name='Format by Category' w='50000' x='50000' y='10000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style></zone>
          <zone h='42000' id='5' name='Format by Time Block' w='50000' x='0' y='52000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style></zone>
          <zone h='42000' id='6' name='Engagement by Month' w='50000' x='50000' y='52000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style></zone>
          <zone h='6000' id='7' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='94000'>
            <formatted-text><run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Small groups: 7 videos, 22 links, 5 non-photo inspiration posts, 8 non-photo afternoon posts, and 7 evening posts. Posting hour is shown as recorded; the dataset does not give a time zone. Data: Moro, Rita &amp; Vala (2016), UCI Machine Learning Repository. Dashboard by Sheriffa Singh.</run></formatted-text>
            <zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='6' /></zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{EDF3FF28-B28F-4BA7-B7F4-7FC9F33EFB9B}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
